DESCRIPTION:National Candy Day is observed on November 4\, and no organizat
 ion appears to have put it there: the confectionery industry's own trade b
 ody does not promote it\, and the date circulates on holiday calendars and
  in individual retailers' promotions without attribution. There was a genu
 ine National Candy Day in American history\, created by the candy trade an
 d documented in contemporary newspapers — but it fell in October\, and i
 t is not this one.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-candy-d
 ay/
